      "content": "The expected rows still depend on the generator machine's current year: `tradeSummary` calls `summaryExpiration`, whose `currentYear` reads `new Date()`. The Node generator does not pin Date, whereas the browser benchmark pins it to the dataset's `asOf`. Consequently, generating the same version in a different year changes option summary cells (adding/removing the expiration year suffix) and can disagree with the benchmark UI. Supply a fixed reference instant/year for this formatting path, or pin the Node formatting clock to `asOf`; add an option-row test with wall-clock and dataset years differing.",
